In order to fix conventions here we recall the definition of standard modules and their contravariant form. 
For this we will first need to fix conventions for $\Sym_n$ Specht modules, where $\Sym_n$ is the symmetric group. 
Observe that the category of symmetric group $\K$-algebras is a monoidal subcategory of $Br$. 

