Thus we see that both one-dimensional $\Delta$-modules are submodules. 
By globalisation this means that we have 
\[
\Delta^{n}_{(3,(2))} \oplus \Delta^{n}_{(3,1^2)} \; \rightarrow\; \Delta^{n}_{(1,(1))}
\]
for all odd $n$, with both summands having nonzero image. 
We draw this as
