Passing on to $n=5$ we see, taking $A=(4,(2))$ and $B=(3,(1^2))$ that 
\[
\hom(\Delta^{n}_{(5,(2))} \oplus \Delta^{n}_{(3,(2))} , \Delta^{n}_{(3,(1^2))} ) 
 \cong  
\hom(\Delta^{n-1}_{(4,(2))} , \Delta^{n-1}_{(2,(1^2))} + \Delta^{n-1}_{(4,(1^2))}) 
